<!-- Workboard Archetype — page scaffold for queue / Today / Active Visits / Billing Queue.
     Provides standard page header + filter slot + grouped rows + empty state.
     See docs/ehr/system-design-and-architecture-plan.md §E.

     Required context:
       - header     {title, eyebrow?, subtitle?, primary?, secondary?}
       - kpis[]?    KPI tiles for the strip (see _kpi_strip.disyl)
       - empty?     {title, body?, icon?, cta?}    used when the caller indicates no rows

     Render the row body in the caller; this scaffold supplies header chrome only.
     Caller pattern:
       {include "modules/ehr/partials/_workboard.disyl" with {header: ..., kpis: ...}}
       <section class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white">
         {if rows} ...rows... {else}{include "modules/ehr/partials/_empty_state.disyl" with {empty: ...}}{/if}
       </section>
-->
{include "modules/ehr/partials/_page_header.disyl" with {header: header}}
{if kpis}<div class="mb-5">{include "modules/ehr/partials/_kpi_strip.disyl" with {kpis: kpis}}</div>{/if}
